>Here are the one's I've seen while hallucinating but not in "real life" (?!)
>Totoro, ..., Invid

Totoro is a friendly cuddly cross between a penguin and a cat, from the
Miyazaki movie, "Tonari no Totoro."

The Invid are vicious alien bugs from the TV series "Robotech."

You can also be attacked by "Boomers," terminator type robots from
"Bubble Gum Crisis."

And lastly, you can be attacked by the Ohmu, giant insects from the 
contaminated wastelands in the movie "Nausicaa."  (Also known as "Warriors
of the Wind.")

Yea!  It's really fun to see anime references in NetHack 3.1.  I wonder who
put them in there?

Note, Minmei ("Macross") is illustrated as the nymph in the Wheaton NetHack
